<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten stocks rose, five fell and six were flat in 14.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday, with the WIG 20 index closing 1.3 percent higher at 1,563.7 points.</p>
<p>Only Kety did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.3 percent to 149 zlotys in a 9.4-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
